{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","title":"lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1739,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-normal-at]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-smooth]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-determinant]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-comp-section]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","line":2879,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Smoothness of the Value on a Frame]\n\\label{lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth}\n\n\\uses{def:smooth-normal-at, lem:adapted-frame-smooth, prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames, prop:volume-form-determinant, def:interior-multiplication, def:smooth-orientation, lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian, lem:pullback-comp-section}\n\n\n\n\nIf $N$ varies smoothly along an immersion into an oriented Riemannian $(n+1)$-manifold and $(E_i)$ is a smooth local frame of $TM$, then\n\\[\nx\\mapsto dV_{\\widetilde g}|_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xE_1|_x,\\ldots,dF_xE_n|_x)\n\\]\nis smooth.\n\\end{lemma}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:adapted-frame-smooth,prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames,prop:volume-form-determinant,lem:pullback-comp-section,lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian}\n\\sketch Near $F(x_0)$ choose a smooth oriented orthonormal ambient frame. Proposition \\ref{prop:volume-form-determinant} expresses the displayed value as a determinant of pairings between this frame and the adapted frame. All sections and pairings are smooth by Lemmas \\ref{lem:pullback-comp-section} and \\ref{lem:adapted-frame-smooth}, so the determinant is smooth.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Smoothness of the Value on a Frame] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f726d616c2d72657374726963742d6672616d652d736d6f6f7468\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-normal-at\">↗ def:smooth-normal-at</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aadapted-frame-smooth\">↗ lem:adapted-frame-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aoriented-orthonormal-frames\">↗ prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Avolume-form-determinant\">↗ prop:volume-form-determinant</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-orientation\">↗ def:smooth-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian\">↗ lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-comp-section\">↗ lem:pullback-comp-section</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N$\">$N$</span> varies smoothly along an immersion into an oriented Riemannian <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(n+1)$\">$(n+1)$</span>-manifold and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(E_i)$\">$(E_i)$</span> is a smooth local frame of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$TM$\">$TM$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  x\\mapsto dV_{\\widetilde g}|_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xE_1|_x,\\ldots ,dF_xE_n|_x)  \\]\">\\[  x\\mapsto dV_{\\widetilde g}|_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xE_1|_x,\\ldots ,dF_xE_n|_x)  \\]</span> is smooth.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aadapted-frame-smooth\">↗ lem:adapted-frame-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aoriented-orthonormal-frames\">↗ prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Avolume-form-determinant\">↗ prop:volume-form-determinant</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-comp-section\">↗ lem:pullback-comp-section</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian\">↗ lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian</a> \\sketch Near <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F(x_0)$\">$F(x_0)$</span> choose a smooth oriented orthonormal ambient frame. Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Avolume-form-determinant\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-determinant\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a766f6c756d652d666f726d2d64657465726d696e616e74\">12</a> expresses the displayed value as a determinant of pairings between this frame and the adapted frame. All sections and pairings are smooth by Lemmas <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-comp-section\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-comp-section\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70756c6c6261636b2d636f6d702d73656374696f6e\">8</a> and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aadapted-frame-smooth\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-smooth\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a616461707465642d6672616d652d736d6f6f7468\">8</a>, so the determinant is smooth. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-smooth","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-normal-at","title":"def:smooth-normal-at","label":"def:smooth-normal-at"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-smooth","title":"lem:adapted-frame-smooth","label":"lem:adapted-frame-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames","title":"prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames","label":"prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-determinant","title":"prop:volume-form-determinant","label":"prop:volume-form-determinant"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","label":"def:interior-multiplication"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation","title":"def:smooth-orientation","label":"def:smooth-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian","title":"lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian","label":"lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-comp-section","title":"lem:pullback-comp-section","label":"lem:pullback-comp-section"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","title":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","label":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","title":"prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","label":"prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","title":"lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[Smoothness of the Value on a Frame]\n\\label{lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth}\n\n\\uses{def:smooth-normal-at, lem:adapted-frame-smooth, prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames, prop:volume-form-determinant, def:interior-multiplication, def:smooth-orientation, lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian, lem:pullback-comp-section}\n\n\n\n\nIf $N$ varies smoothly along an immersion into an oriented Riemannian $(n+1)$-manifold and $(E_i)$ is a smooth local frame of $TM$, then\n\\[\nx\\mapsto dV_{\\widetilde g}|_{F(x)}(N_x,dF_xE_1|_x,\\ldots,dF_xE_n|_x)\n\\]\nis smooth.\n\\end{lemma}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:adapted-frame-smooth,prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames,prop:volume-form-determinant,lem:pullback-comp-section,lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian}\n\\sketch Near $F(x_0)$ choose a smooth oriented orthonormal ambient frame. Proposition \\ref{prop:volume-form-determinant} expresses the displayed value as a determinant of pairings between this frame and the adapted frame. All sections and pairings are smooth by Lemmas \\ref{lem:pullback-comp-section} and \\ref{lem:adapted-frame-smooth}, so the determinant is smooth.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-normal-at","title":"def:smooth-normal-at","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-smooth","title":"lem:adapted-frame-smooth","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames","title":"prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-determinant","title":"prop:volume-form-determinant","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation","title":"def:smooth-orientation","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian","title":"lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-comp-section","title":"lem:pullback-comp-section","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}